ev("CBS/AP June 11, 2003: clothing found in Comanche Peak Wilderness several hundred feet above trail; jacket appeared intact, pants inside out with right leg missing; DOW's Fred Quartarone; forensics expert Jack Swanburg.",["P020","P021",r_dow2,r_swan],"CBS030611")
ev("AP June 9, 2003: LCSO spokeswoman Eloise Campanella; clothing ~550 feet from trail; trail dedicated to Jaryd in October 2000 by then-President Clinton; LCSO handed out whistles.",["P018",r_camp,"P024",r_law3,r_whistle],"PLV030609")
